Modifications: full-alphabet double C input validation and global top3; fixed
126/42 windows; three reviewed beam patch semantics; fixed value-owned node
storage; stable insertion-order ranking; shared exact-node dedup/refractory;
row-level transactional state; bounded identity, clock and output contracts;
chunk and float32 promotion APIs; isolated test-only hooks. No model, audio,
weights, private corpus, production integration or publication is included.

The expansion-summation arithmetic is implemented for this adapter's finite
nonnegative bounded input contract, with explicit binary64 rounding assumptions.
Boundary agreement with Python math.fsum remains a required unrun validation.
